    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After a long expedition through the new legal territory, gatekeeper enforcers in Brussels have blocked Google's proposed path forward. The multinational corporation now faces a landmark fine under the digital markets framework, a historic toll for prioritizing its own comparison units over rival explorers. This penalty, expected before the summer pause, adds another marker to Alphabet's long trail of regulatory confrontation.",
